          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "Greta is in the garden painting a picture of the beautiful things around her, but she’s got a problem: she can’t find green paint anywhere! But not to worry, today she and Sunny will spend the day learning about all things green: broccoli, kiwi, cucumbers, and more! Spider, Worm and Butterfly tell the story of “The Enormous Broccoli”, they learn how to make yummy Broccoli Slaw, and they close out their lush day with a game of “Green or Not Green.”",
